        "original_id": "2c0e7f90-cf44-55de-80db-5e14c650d437",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Uri Singer, Andy García, Juliette Lewis, Camilla Belle, Frank Whaley, Leighton Meester, Debra Messing, Billie Joe Armstrong, Michael Almereyda, Peter Sarsgaard, Winona Ryder, Tim Burton\n- Products: Open Road, Like Sunday, Like Rain, Experimenter, Beetlejuice\n- Roles: producer, writer, director, actor\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, Winona Ryder won critical acclaim and widespread recognition for playing Lydia Deetz, a goth teenager, in Tim Burton's film \"Beetlejuice.\"\n- Uri Singer has produced multiple award-winning films, including \"Open Road,\" which featured Andy García, Juliette Lewis, and Camilla Belle.\n- Uri Singer produced \"Like Sunday, Like Rain,\" which was written and directed by Frank Whaley and starred Leighton Meester, Debra Messing, and Billie Joe Armstrong.\n- Uri Singer produced \"Experimenter,\" which was written and directed by Michael Almereyda and starred Peter Sarsgaard and Winona Ryder.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
